  {
    "title": "Edge cases",
    "body": "**Inactive followers:** pushing to users who have not opened the app in 30 days wastes writes; skip them and build their feed by pulling when they return, at the cost of a slower first load. **A new follow:** copy the followed account's latest few post IDs into the feed at once, so the next open shows them. **Unfollows and deleted posts:** the feed service filters them out when reading, so the cache can be cleaned later. **An account crossing the threshold:** posts already pushed stay; the merge drops duplicates by post ID.",
